        "created_at": "2017-08-03T17:38:33.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Since the boxes aren't particularly snug, I was able to fit them in two of the other characters' boxes. I didn't bother with the plastic bits, since I could always just poach them from whatever characters weren't being played when we use them!</p>",
